SUMMARY:Free Movies in The Beach - Fantastic Four 2025 + Pre-dinner/Ice cr
 eam (Queen E.)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\nOn **Wednesday\, July 29th\, join us for F
 ree Movies in The Beach\, with The Fantastic Four\, 90% on Rotten Tomatoes
 .** We will start off with optional Dinner in the Beach\, followed by opti
 onal ice cream\, prior to entering Kew Gardens\, where we will settle down
  for movie start around sunset. This is an outdoor event. If rain is forec
 ast\, The Beach BIA will reschedule to a later date and I will post a canc
 ellation maximum 3 hours prior.\n\n**Movie Synopsis**\nForced to balance t
 heir roles as heroes with the strength of their family bond\, the Fantasti
 c Four must defend Earth from a ravenous space god called Galactus and his
  enigmatic herald\, the Silver Surfer.\n\n**Know Before You Go**\n\n* **Se
 ating:** Bring your own **blankets or lawn chairs** as no seating is provi
 ded.\n* **Weather**: bring an extra sweater/coat and bug spray\n* **Pre-sh
 ow Activities:** There are pre-show games\, trivia\, and giveaways startin
 g shortly before sunset.\n* **Shop & Win:** You can bring receipts from lo
 cal Queen Street East businesses to enter a raffle for prizes sponsored by
  the Beach BIA.\n* **Food:** Pack your own snacks or grab takeout from loc
 al Queen Street East restaurants to enjoy as a picnic. You are welcome to 
 join us for dinner before.\n\n**COST**\nFree\n\n**SIGNING-UP**\n\n* **RSVP
  Yes confirming if you will join for dinner/ice cream/both prior**\n* You 
 can also just show up at any of the meeting times below\n\nA reminder will
  be sent the day before with my cell and reminder details where to meet an
 d when.\n\nRSVPs close 1 day prior. Cancellations will result in a No Show
  and impact future attendance.\n\n**MEETUP TIME**\n**Meet me for Dinner at
 : 6:15pm at Gull & Firkin\, 1943 Queen St. E.**\n\n**Meet me for Ice cream
  at: 7:30pm at Beaches N Cream\, 2075 Queen St. E.**\n\n**Meet me for the 
 Show at: 8:15pm in front of Kew Gardens at 2039 Queen St. E.**\n\n**Movie 
 Start: Sunset @ 8:42pm**\n\nMovie Length: 1 hour 55mins\n\nEnjoy and pleas
 e post your comments in the Event after.
